### 회원가입
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/user/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "testuser01",
  "pw": "Password1!",
  "name": "홍길동",
  "birth": "1995-06-15",
  "email": "testuser01@example.com"
}

### 회원가입 - 비밀번호 유효성 실패 (8자 미만)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/user/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "testuser02",
  "pw": "Short1!",
  "name": "김철수",
  "birth": "1990-01-01",
  "email": "testuser02@example.com"
}

### 회원가입 - 비밀번호에 생년월일 포함
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/user/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "testuser03",
  "pw": "19900101ab!",
  "name": "이영희",
  "birth": "1990-01-01",
  "email": "testuser03@example.com"
}

### 내 정보 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/user/info
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

### 비밀번호 변경
PUT {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Password1!

{
  "prevPw": "Password1!",
  "nextPw": "NewPass1!!"
}
